ck <code class=\"notranslate\">ruff</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ruff-format</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">codespell</code> errors on <code class=\"notranslate\">line 313</code>?<br>\nIf you try the following command: <code class=\"notranslate\">pre-commit run --all-file</code>, it should help fix these errors.</p>"},{"url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57713#pullrequestreview-1926697032","body":"","user":{"login":"natmokval","name":"natmokval","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91160475?u=1a5d4b50317b2632f5509b6baea3145e8544ecb9&v=4","id":91160475},"id":1926697032,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":"2024-03-10T20:55:46Z","updated_at":null,"review":"COMMENTED","side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":""},{"url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57713#discussion_r1518980445","body":"Thank you for noticing code duplication in `pandas/tests/indexes/period/test_period_range.py`. I am not sure how it’s related to this bug.  Could you please move these changes to separate PR?","user":{"login":"natmokval","name":"natmokval","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91160475?v=4","id":91160475},"id":1518980445,"pull_request_review_id":1926697351,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":"2024-03-10T20:57:59Z","updated_at":"2024-03-10T21:04:22Z","review":null,"side":"LEFT","line":116,"start_line":null,"path":"pandas/tests/indexes/period/test_period_range.py","body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\">Thank you for noticing code duplication in <code class=\"notranslate\">pandas/tests/indexes/period/test_period_range.py</code>. I am not sure how it’s related to this bug.  Could you please move these changes to separate PR?</p>"},{"url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57713#pullrequestreview-1926697351","body":"","user":{"login":"natmokval","name":"natmokval","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91160475?u=1a5d