:75,"start_line":null,"path":"pandas/tests/plotting/test_datetimelike.py","body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\">instead of the comments, e.g. <code class=\"notranslate\"># Setup your DataFrame as in your scenario</code>, could you please just add the number of GitHub issue: <code class=\"notranslate\"># GH#57594</code></p>"},{"url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57713#pullrequestreview-1926703887","body":"","user":{"login":"natmokval","name":"natmokval","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91160475?u=1a5d4b50317b2632f5509b6baea3145e8544ecb9&v=4","id":91160475},"id":1926703887,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":"2024-03-10T21:09:44Z","updated_at":null,"review":"COMMENTED","side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":""},{"url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57713#issuecomment-1987366987","body":"Thanks @NoelMT for working on this. Seems like it will fix the problem with visualisation of `DataFrame` if `PeriodIndex` as index provided.\r\ne.g. for the first scenario:\r\n```\r\nfrom pandas import *\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\nidx = period_range(\"01/01/2000\", freq='7h', periods=4)\r\ndf = DataFrame(\r\n    np.array([0, 1, 0, 1]),\r\n    index=idx,\r\n    columns=[\"A\"],\r\n)\r\ndf.plot()\r\nprint(df)\r\n```\r\n\r\nplot before:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"552\" alt=\"res_7h\" src=\"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/assets/91160475/47bccd86-a957-42e1-b021-de15e63cf85e\">\r\n\r\nplot after:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"620\" alt=\"dfplot_7h_correct\" src=\"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/assets/91160475/235ed96a-8b94-4d50-9cb4-181a387e9242\">\r\n","user":{"login":"natmokval","name":"natmokval","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91160475?v=4","id":91160475},"id":1987366987,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":"2024-03-10T21:23:11Z","updated_at":"2024-03-10T21:23:11Z","review":null,"side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/NoelMT/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/NoelMT\">@NoelMT</a> for working on this. Seems like it will fix the problem with visualisation of <code class=\"notranslate\">DataFrame</code> if <code class=\"notranslate\">PeriodIndex</code> as index provided.<br>\ne.g. for the first scenario:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"from pandas import *\nimport numpy as np\n\nidx = period_range(&quot;01/01/2000&quot;, freq='7h', periods=4)\ndf = DataFrame(\n    np.array([0, 1, 0, 1]),\n    index=idx,\n    columns=[&quot;A&quot;],\n)\ndf.plot()\nprint(df)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">from pandas import *\nimport numpy as np\n\nidx = period_range(\"01/01/2000\", freq='7h', periods=4)\ndf = DataFrame(\n    np.array([0, 1, 0, 1]),\n    index=idx,\n    columns=[\"A\"],\n)\ndf.plot()\nprint(df)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">plot before:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/91160475/311544914-47bccd86-a957-42e1-b021-de15e63cf85e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..QDvcfmuGdCKCUCtcl0D2RYQlC9PjXe2nxOCdnGjwS38\"><img width=\"552\" alt=\"res_7h\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/91160475/311544914-47bccd86-a957-42e1-b021-de15e63cf85e.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..QDvcfmuGdCKCUCtcl0D2RYQlC9PjXe2nxOCdnGjwS38\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">plot after:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/91160475/311544924-235ed96a-8b94-4d50-9cb4-181a387e9242.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..BiEXjMGDL28PZ6BH7Q5PiJkvqiT6ECiKlD1Iqt0eBDE\"><img width=\"620\" alt=\"dfplot_7h_correct\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/91160475/311544924-235ed96a-8b94-4d50-9cb4-181a387e9242.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..BiEXjMGDL28PZ6BH7Q5PiJkvqiT6ECiKlD1Iqt0eBDE\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>"},{"url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57713#issuecomment-1987369032","body":"@NoelMT could you please add a note to `doc/source/whatsnew/v3.0.0.rst` in the section\r\nhttps://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/blob/dc19148bf7197a928a129b1d1679b1445a7ea7c7/doc/source/whatsnew/v3.0.0.rst?plain=1#L356\r\n","user":{"login":"natmokval","name":"natmokval","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91160475?v=4","id":91160475},"id":1987369032,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":"2024-03-10T21:31:43Z","updated_at":"2024-03-10T21:31:43Z","review":null,"side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/NoelMT/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/NoelMT\">@NoelMT</a> could you please add a note to <code class=\"notranslate\">doc/source/whatsnew/v3.0.0.rst</code> in the section<br>\n</p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/blob/dc19148bf7197a928a129b1d1679b1445a7ea7c7/doc/source/whatsnew/v3.0.0.rst?plain=1#L356\">pandas/doc/source/whatsnew/v3.0.0.rst</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n         Line 356\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/pandas-dev/pandas/commit/dc19148bf7197a928a129b1d1679b1445a7ea7c7\">dc19148</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class