{"n":57726,"comments":[{"url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57726#issuecomment-1977451247","body":"Merging to get part of the CI to green","user":{"login":"mroeschke","name":"mroeschke","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10647082?v=4","id":10647082},"id":1977451247,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":"2024-03-04T21:03:39Z","updated_at":"2024-03-04T21:03:39Z","review":null,"side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\">Merging to get part of the CI to green</p>"},{"url":"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57726#issuecomment-1977452103","body":"Owee, I'm MrMeeseeks, Look at me.\n\nThere seem to be a conflict, please backport manually. Here are approximate instructions:\n\n1. Checkout backport branch and update it.\n\n```\ngit checkout 2.2.x\ngit pull\n```\n\n2. Cherry pick the first parent branch of the this PR on top of the older branch:\n```\ngit cherry-pick -x -m1 c3ae17d04d3993e1c3e4c0f8824fde03b8c9beac\n```\n\n3. You will likely have some merge/cherry-pick conflict here, fix them and commit:\n\n```\ngit commit -am 'Backport PR #57726: TST/CI: Fix test_repr on musl for dateutil 2.9'\n```\n\n4. Push to a named branch:\n\n```\ngit push YOURFORK 2.2.x:auto-backport-of-pr-57726-on-2.2.x\n```\n\n5. Create a PR against branch 2.2.x, I would have named this PR:\n\n> \"Backport PR #57726 on branch 2.2.x (TST/CI: Fix test_repr on musl for dateutil 2.9)\"\n\nAnd apply the correct labels and milestones.\n\nCongratulations — you did some good work! Hopefully your backport PR will be tested by the continuous integration and merged soon!\n\nRemember to remove the `Still Needs Manual Backport` label once the PR gets merged.\n\nIf these instructions are inaccurate, feel free to [suggest an improvement](https://github.com/MeeseeksBox/MeeseeksDev).\n                ","user":{"login":"lumberbot-app[bot]","name":"lumberbot-app[bot]","email":null,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/812?v=4","id":24485218},"id":1977452103,"pull_request_review_id":null,"in_reply_to_id":null,"created_at":"2024-03-04T21:04:16Z","updated_at":"2024-03-04T21:04:16Z","review":null,"side":null,"line":null,"start_line":null,"path":null,"body_html":"<p dir=\"auto\">Owee, I'm MrMeeseeks, Look at me.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There seem to be a conflict, please backport manually. Here are approximate instructions:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Checkout backport branch and update it.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git checkout 2.2.x\ngit pull\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">git checkout 2.2.x\ngit pull\n</code></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"2\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Cherry pick the first parent branch of the this PR on top of the older branch:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git cherry-pick -x -m1 c3ae17d04d3993e1c3e4c0f8824fde03b8c9beac\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">git cherry-pick -x -m1 c3ae17d04d3993e1c3e4c0f8824fde03b8c9beac\n</code></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"3\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>You will likely have some merge/cherry-pick conflict here, fix them and commit:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git commit -am 'Backport PR #57726: TST/CI: Fix test_repr on musl for dateutil 2.9'\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">git commit -am 'Backport PR #57726: TST/CI: Fix test_repr on musl for dateutil 2.9'\n</code></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"4\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Push to a named branch:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git push YOURFORK 2.2.x:auto-backport-of-pr-57726-on-2.2.x\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">git push YOURFORK 2.2.x:auto-backport-of-pr-57726-on-2.2.x\n</code></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"5\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Create a PR against branch 2.2.x, I would have named this PR:</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\"Backport PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2167586505\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/issues/57726\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57726/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/57726\">#57726</a> on branch 2.2.x (TST/CI: Fix test_repr on musl for dateutil 2.9)\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">And apply the correct labels and milestones.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Congratulations — you did some good work! Hopefully your backport PR will be tested by the continuous integration and merged soon!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Remember to remove the <code class=\"notranslate\">Still Needs Manual Backport</code> label once the PR gets merged.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If these instructions are inaccurate, feel free to <a href=\"https://github.com/MeeseeksBox/MeeseeksDev\">suggest an improvement</a>.</p>"}]}
